          </p>

          <p>
            We use cost per 25 g because tub prices and scoop sizes vary so much that the sticker price tells you very little. A $12.94 plant tub looks cheaper than a $19.87 whey tub, but it holds less than half the protein. The same trap catches shoppers comparing a 2 lb name-brand tub with a 24 oz store-brand tub. Divide the price by the total grams of protein on the panel, multiply by 25, and the ranking becomes obvious.
