          <p>
            Equate's collagen and shakes are a different calculation. The 10 oz collagen tub was $16.94 with 9 g of protein per serving per Walmart, but collagen lacks tryptophan and is low in leucine, so it is not a substitute for whey when the goal is muscle; see our <a href="/collagen-vs-protein-powder/">collagen vs protein powder</a> breakdown. Equate's ready-to-drink shakes are convenient, but bottled protein nearly always costs more per gram than a tub of powder.
