                  Yes. Equate whey protein powder is sweetened with sucralose and acesulfame potassium, per the label at the time of writing, and the plant-based powder uses erythritol and sucralose. Both are FDA-approved, but if you avoid artificial sweeteners you will need a different tub. The whey also contains milk and a small amount of lactose from its whey concentrate.
